{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Clear OTel MDC on the handler worker.** This waits for `executionFuture` before registering the following continuation, so `onInvocationEnd` runs on the invocation caller. Both OTel plugins set MDC on the handler worker, and clearing it from another thread leaves stale trace/span fields when that executor thread is reused. Clear `MdcSpanEnricher` from the handler-scoped close and add a reused-worker test with MDC enabled.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75wxpD","finding_digest":"29109d2eede21e7996c603051ada31c89f3d7f9bdff4001c410e0effa5c9927d","finding_id":"arf_v1_feij2lxn4iphtfwgamcrvwrrzc","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::execute::otel-mdc-owner-thread-cleanup","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::execute::otel-mdc-owner-thread-cleanup","line":139,"observation_digest":"41c3d093eb60a2cfef7ae22e615fb2048d192d3daa20f819256af007baf15485","observation_id":"aro_v1_ihb5be7lmcrm73324ixgcx5sas","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:33:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_grmj63ih7rnh7kcttdvmaefrnm","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"aa073e4bfa1f0cdcc78d4719e3ed79ff3b4d38fd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":133,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_f3m6tdaixeg5oge4wznzbn3n7k","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:33:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
